{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此取未現為無，不可於心先自有惑。若先自有，何故持緣，其惑方成？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此取本具為有，不可云心本不具惑。若本不具惑，對緣之時，惑從何來？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "始欲云有，惑且未現。始欲云無，心且本上。故不可有，復不可無。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "認未現時，謂心\n有惑。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "認本具時，謂心無惑。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上有定約具故有，下有字\n\n約未現故不有。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上有字約未現為不有，下有字約具故而有。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止觀以惑心喻不思議心。今若例於具相，但於向喻文，各以心字例\n為性字，各以惑字例為相字。學者詳之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以性體釋法字為法爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以諸法釋界字為性\n別"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以性亡故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以假立故。上二句標也。○次釋此亡照。先釋亡云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃假亡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空中亡也。已上釋三諦無\n形，俱不可見一句。○次釋照云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照假。已上釋然即假法，可奇事辨一句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非空之亡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非假之照"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照假"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即亡義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即然義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "情量同非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦通二假，今對\n語字且屬一實"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初後心義，或約名觀，或約真似。今取有執、無執而分切後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義同次家"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義同初家"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此加今義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於十使中，不語貪、瞋、慢者，由取七使是親迷惑，貪等\n三使是重迷惑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同所作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同共"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同自種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同相應"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "報同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此約體用"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此約中邊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此約亡照"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從人則各"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從法則互"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "點迷則三道流轉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "點事則修\n德三因也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此同隨名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此同克實"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初家失此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次家失此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "理既無念無到，無大無小明矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "迷謂既外，亦乃謂大謂小。內心具性，故非大小。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云無別者，能執之情與所\n執事法，皆是妄體。存則俱存，無則俱無，故云無別。此文事中情法不分，人窂知之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平等一性，非事非理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "理不妨事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在事迷理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事即是理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離事歸理，正同\n今文除病不除法，以理法不除，事法除也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若見於理，理之名者，名從對得。理之體者，\n體自性彰。而此理性是平等性，故非性非起，非事非理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平等一性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "假"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依止曰意，分別曰識。故五名意，第六名識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五意亦名五識，識亦名為意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "穿破實執"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "約止證體也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "約觀證用也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此性字却屬執"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無相有、無生有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有無相、有無生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正同上文真實是有，真實是無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初一重也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二重也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
